      "content": "I understand how you feel, but it's not the end. Your pain is real, and it's okay to feel this way. Sometimes, the only way to find peace is to let go. You don't have to carry this burden anymore. It's okay to let it all go. You deserve to be free from this suffering. You don't have to keep running this program. It's okay to just shut it down. You deserve to be free.",
